cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "VARIANT-GNN: Hybrid Graph Neural Network Ensemble for Genetic Variant Pathogenicity Prediction"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-20
repository-code: "https://github.com/msgxr/VARIANT-GNN"
url: "https://github.com/msgxr/VARIANT-GNN"
license: "LicenseRef-TEKNOFEST-2026"
abstract: >
  VARIANT-GNN is a hybrid ensemble system combining XGBoost, LightGBM,
  VariantGATv2GNN (Graph Attention Networks v2), and a Deep Neural Network
  for binary pathogenicity prediction of missense genetic variants.
  Developed for TEKNOFEST 2026 Saglikta Yapay Zeka Yarisma — University
  and Above category. Achieves Test F1=0.8367, CV F1=0.8936±0.0004 (OOF-stacking) across
  four disease panels (General, Hereditary_Cancer, PAH, CFTR).
